🧠 PRD – BrainBinge (AI Professor Learning Platform)
“Learn anything through a fun, talking AI professor — choose your teacher, tone, and dive into interactive lessons.”
🎯 1. Purpose

BrainBinge makes learning interactive, personal, and entertaining.
Users can upload or paste lesson material and learn through an AI professor that:

Speaks in realistic, personality-driven voices (Snoop Dogg, Morgan Freeman, comedian, etc.),

Explains the material conversationally through an audio-chat interface,

Asks questions along the way to reinforce understanding, and

Saves every session for replay later.

Everything happens in one beautiful, dark-mode desktop interface:
📚 Lesson overview (left) | 💬 Chat + audio playback (right) | 📁 Sidebar for saved sessions.

🧩 2. Core Features
Category	Feature	Description
Lesson Input	Upload PDF / Paste Text / Paste Link	Add learning material (notes, Wikipedia, slides).
	AI Lesson Parser	GPT extracts topics and builds an outline (overview, key points, examples).
Main Learning Experience	Dual-Panel Layout	Left: Lesson overview. Right: live chat + audio narration.
	AI Professor Chat	Conversational teaching flow, tone-aware personality.
	Voice Personalities	Choose Snoop-style, Freeman-style, Comedian, or Classic Mentor.
	Audio Narration	Real-time speech synthesis (ElevenLabs/PlayHT).
	Inline Questions	AI asks you to respond mid-lesson (“Explain this in your words”).
	Chat Display	Text bubbles sync perfectly with spoken voice.
Session Management	Auto-Save Sessions	Auto-saves title, subject, date to sidebar.
	Replay Mode	Reopen previous sessions with synced audio + transcript.
Secondary Feature	Podcast Creator	Combine lessons into longer voice-acted podcasts.
Customization	Humor filter (PG / PG-13 / R), playback speed, preferred voice pack, dark theme controls.	
🧭 3. User Flow
1️⃣ Dashboard

Sidebar (left): Home, Saved Sessions, Podcasts, Settings.

Center: “Create New Lesson” card.

Right: Recent sessions list (latest on top).

2️⃣ Upload Lesson

Upload file or paste link/text.

Pick:

Subject name,

Voice personality,

Humor tone.

Click Start Lesson.

3️⃣ Learning Window

Split 50/50 Layout:

Left Panel:

Lesson overview (headings, definitions, examples).

Scrollable static content.

Right Panel:

Chat + voice output (AI professor speaking).

Inline questions appear as message bubbles.

You type answers → AI responds verbally and textually.

4️⃣ Save & Review

Session automatically saved to sidebar:
Physics – Thermodynamics – 10/10/2025.

Click any saved item → replay the chat and audio.

5️⃣ Podcast Creation

From dashboard → select multiple sessions → Generate Podcast.

AI merges them into a continuous, voice-acted episode.

🎨 4. Design System – Dark Mode
✴️ Overall Look

Sleek, cinematic dark-mode interface — easy on the eyes, high contrast, and immersive.
A balance between Spotify (audio vibe) and Linear (modern SaaS polish).

🌈 Color Palette
Element	Color	Description
Background	#0F1116	Deep navy-black, not pure black — less strain
Cards / Panels	#1A1D24	Slightly lighter grey for contrast
Primary Accent	Gradient #7C4DFF → #2F80ED	Electric violet-to-blue for modern contrast
Secondary Accent	#56CCF2	Light blue used sparingly for highlights
Text – Main	#EDEEF1	Soft white
Text – Muted	#9EA1AA	Grey for timestamps, subtitles
Dividers / Shadows	rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)	Subtle light dividers
Correct Answer	#27AE60	Green accent
Error / R-Mode	#EB5757	Red accent
Button Hover Glow	rgba(124,77,255,0.4)	Faint purple aura on hover
🧱 Shape & Style

Rounded corners: 16–20px on all cards and containers.

Chat bubbles: rounded with glowing border (accent gradient).

Sidebar: darker tone (#14161C) with bright hover highlights.

Buttons: fully rounded (pill-style) with glowing gradient fill.

Avatars: circular, with faint ring glow matching chosen voice color.

Scrollbars: thin, semi-transparent, auto-fade.

🧠 Typography
Type	Font	Style
Primary	Inter / Satoshi	Smooth, geometric sans-serif
Headers	22–28px, bold, white	
Body	16–18px, medium, off-white	
Muted	14px, grey

🎧 UI Composition

Sidebar left (260px).

Lesson panel center (~40%).

Chat/audio panel right (~60%).

Consistent spacing, glowing gradients for CTAs, fluid animations (fade-in for messages).

🧱 5. Supabase Database Schema
users
Column	Type	Description
id	uuid (PK)	User ID
email	text	Email
name	text	Display name
preferences	jsonb	Voice, tone, theme defaults
created_at	timestamptz	Timestamp
lessons
Column	Type	Description
id	uuid (PK)	Lesson ID
user_id	uuid (FK → users.id)	Owner
title	text	Lesson title
