sessions
Column	Type	Description
id	uuid (PK)	Session ID
lesson_id	uuid (FK → lessons.id)	Linked lesson
title	text	Display title
chat_log	jsonb	Full message exchange
audio_urls	jsonb	TTS audio clip URLs
score	numeric	Understanding score
created_at	timestamptz	Timestamp
podcasts
Column	Type	Description
id	uuid (PK)	Podcast ID
user_id	uuid (FK → users.id)	Owner
title	text	Podcast name
lessons_included	jsonb	Array of lesson IDs
